sysmanage-canary watches a SysManage server from the outside and sends
email when something stops working: the web console, the backend health
endpoint, the database (connection, query latency, connections in use),
outbound networking, and silence from agents that should be checking in.

It is a separate program on purpose.  It never imports server code and
runs on the system Python, so a broken server, virtualenv or database
cannot take the watcher down with it.  It can run on the server itself
or, better, on a second machine.
